§§ `The ladders of the closed periods, as printed`

-- Subsections (ג), (ג1) and (ג1א) are updated by s 9(ג2) every tax year from a base index (15 January 1995, 15 January 1999 and 15 October 2007), so the amounts the consolidation prints are
-- ONE year's amounts, and the consolidation does not say which year. These ladders are therefore here only as printed, for the arithmetic of the ladder; NO DAY is answered from them
-- (`the ladder in force on` gives NOTHING for a day in these periods). CONSOLIDATION-ONLY.
