§§ `The day-to-ladder table`

-- The tax years of the editor's note run from 16 January to 15 January. The frozen amounts of SH 5785 hold from 1 January 2025 (SH 5785 p. 152, s 3(a)); s 9(ג2) now skips the update
-- on 16 January of 2025, 2026 and 2027, so the next update day is 16 January 2028 and the frozen amounts hold through 15 January 2028 (fork V1 in NOTES.md).
`the first day of the frozen amounts of section 9` MEANS Date 1 1 2025
`the last day of the frozen amounts of section 9` MEANS Date 15 1 2028

GIVEN day IS A DATE, from IS A DATE, to IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the day falls from` MEANS day AT LEAST from AND day AT MOST to

-- NOTHING for any day the sources give no figure for: never the nearest vintage.
GIVEN which IS A `Which ladder of section 9`, day IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE `A ladder in force on a day`
`the ladder in force on` MEANS
    CONSIDER which
    WHEN `the general ladder of (ג1ג)(1)` THEN
        BRANCH
            IF `the day falls from` day (Date 1 8 2013) (Date 15 1 2014)
            THEN JUST (`A ladder in force on a day` OF `the general ladder of (ג1ג)(1), 2013 as created`, `read from the official page`, `read from the official page`)
            IF `the day falls from` day (`the first day of the frozen amounts of section 9`) (`the last day of the frozen amounts of section 9`)
            THEN JUST (`A ladder in force on a day` OF `the general ladder of (ג1ג)(1) as from 1 January 2025`, `read from the official page`, `the consolidation only`)
            OTHERWISE NOTHING
    WHEN `the single-dwelling ladder of (ג1ג)(3)` THEN
        BRANCH
            IF `the day falls from` day (Date 1 8 2013) (Date 15 1 2014)
            THEN JUST (`A ladder in force on a day` OF `the single-dwelling ladder of (ג1ג)(3), 2013 as created`, `read from the official page`, `read from the official page`)
            IF `the day falls from` day (Date 16 1 2022) (Date 15 1 2023)
            THEN JUST (`A ladder in force on a day` OF `the single-dwelling ladder of (ג1ג)(3), adjusted for 2022`, `the consolidation only`, `the consolidation only`)
            IF `the day falls from` day (Date 16 1 2023) (Date 15 1 2024)
            THEN JUST (`A ladder in force on a day` OF `the single-dwelling ladder of (ג1ג)(3), adjusted for 2023`, `the consolidation only`, `the consolidation only`)
            IF `the day falls from` day (Date 16 1 2024) (Date 31 12 2024)
            THEN JUST (`A ladder in force on a day` OF `the single-dwelling ladder of (ג1ג)(3), adjusted for 2024`, `the consolidation only`, `the consolidation only`)
            IF `the day falls from` day (`the first day of the frozen amounts of section 9`) (`the last day of the frozen amounts of section 9`)
            THEN JUST (`A ladder in force on a day` OF `the single-dwelling ladder of (ג1ג)(3) as from 1 January 2025`, `read from the official page`, `the consolidation only`)
            OTHERWISE NOTHING
    WHEN `the temporary ladder of (ג1ו)(1)` THEN
        BRANCH
            IF `the day falls from` day (Date 28 11 2021) (Date 15 1 2022)
            THEN JUST (`A ladder in force on a day` OF `the temporary ladder of (ג1ו)(1) as first enacted`, `read from the official page`, `read from the official page`)
            IF `the day falls from` day (`the first day of the frozen amounts of section 9`) (`the last day of the frozen amounts of section 9`)
            THEN JUST (`A ladder in force on a day` OF `the temporary ladder of (ג1ו)(1) as from 1 January 2025`, `read from the official page`, `read from the official page`)
            OTHERWISE NOTHING
    WHEN `the transitional general ladder of (ג1ב)(1)` THEN
        IF `the day falls from` day (Date 6 5 2013) (Date 31 7 2013)
        THEN JUST (`A ladder in force on a day` OF `the transitional general ladder of (ג1ב)(1) as printed`, `the consolidation only`, `the consolidation only`)
        ELSE NOTHING
    WHEN `the transitional single-dwelling ladder of (ג1ב)(2)` THEN
        IF `the day falls from` day (Date 6 5 2013) (Date 31 7 2013)
        THEN JUST (`A ladder in force on a day` OF `the transitional single-dwelling ladder of (ג1ב)(2)(א) as printed`, `the consolidation only`, `the consolidation only`)
        ELSE NOTHING

§§ `The money figures of the residential exemptions, ss 49A(a1), 49E and 49G`

-- The five amounts below were read from SH 5785 pp. 151-152 (listed in the header above), effective 1 January 2025. They are the Law's own text: each is printed in the consolidation with the note
-- "adjusted to 2025", and the freeze law replaced them. What is NOT held is every earlier vintage (the amounts before 1 January 2025) and the update that begins in 2028: a sale on any day outside the
-- windows below is NOTHING, never the nearest vintage.
-- Windows. s 49A(a1) and s 49E(a2) update "at the beginning of each tax year, except tax years 2025 to 2027": the 2025 amounts hold for a sale from 1 January 2025 to 31 December 2027.
-- s 49G(5) updates "once a year, except tax years 2025 to 2027, on 16 January": the 2025 amounts hold from 1 January 2025 to 15 January 2028.
DECLARE `A money figure of the residential exemptions` IS ONE OF
    `the ceiling of section 49A(a1)`
    `the combined-value limit of section 49E(a)(3)`
    `the larger combined-value limit of section 49E(a1)`
    `the bound of the additional exemption in section 49G(2)`
    `the minimum exemption of section 49G(3)`

DECLARE `An exemption figure on a day` HAS
    `its amount` IS A NUMBER
    `where it was read` IS A `Where a figure was read`

-- src:725 | (א1) על אף האמור בסעיף 49ב, עלה סכום שווי המכירה על 5,008,000 שקלים חדשים [note: (מתואם לשנת 2025)] (בסעיף קטן זה – סכום התקרה), יהיה המוכר זכאי לפטור ממס על חלק השווי שעד סכום התקרה, ויראו את סכום ההפרש שבין שווי המכירה לסכום התקרה כדמי מכר של זכות אחרת בדירת מגורים מזכה החייבת במס אשר שווי רכישתה הוא חלק יחסי משווי הרכישה של הזכות כולה, כיחס חלק שווי המכירה המתייחס לזכות זו למלוא שווי המכירה, ובהתאם לכך ייוחסו גם הניכויים והתוספות; הסכום הנקוב בסעיף קטן זה יתואם בתחילת כל שנת מס, למעט בשנות המס 2025 עד 2027, לפי שיעור עליית המדד, לעומת המדד שפורסם לאחרונה לפני יום כ״ב בטבת התשפ״ז (1 בינואר 2027), ויעוגל ל־1,000 השקלים החדשים הקרובים.
-- ext:[SH 5785 p.151, s 2(2), read from the page image] 5,008,000.
-- ext:[SH 5785 p.152, s 2(3), read from the page image] 2,252,000 and 3,746,000 (section 49E).
-- ext:[SH 5785 p.152, s 2(4), read from the page image] 2,428,100 and 607,000 (section 49G).
GIVEN which IS A `A money figure of the residential exemptions`, day IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE `An exemption figure on a day`
`the exemption figure on` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `the day falls from` day (Date 1 1 2025) (Date 31 12 2027)
        THEN CONSIDER which
            WHEN `the ceiling of section 49A(a1)` THEN JUST (`An exemption figure on a day` OF 5_008_000 , `read from the official page`)
            WHEN `the combined-value limit of section 49E(a)(3)` THEN JUST (`An exemption figure on a day` OF 2_252_000 , `read from the official page`)
            WHEN `the larger combined-value limit of section 49E(a1)` THEN JUST (`An exemption figure on a day` OF 3_746_000 , `read from the official page`)
            WHEN `the bound of the additional exemption in section 49G(2)` THEN
                JUST (`An exemption figure on a day` OF 2_428_100 , `read from the official page`)
            WHEN `the minimum exemption of section 49G(3)` THEN JUST (`An exemption figure on a day` OF 607_000 , `read from the official page`)
        IF `the day falls from` day (Date 1 1 2028) (Date 15 1 2028)
        THEN CONSIDER which
            WHEN `the bound of the additional exemption in section 49G(2)` THEN
                JUST (`An exemption figure on a day` OF 2_428_100 , `read from the official page`)
            WHEN `the minimum exemption of section 49G(3)` THEN JUST (`An exemption figure on a day` OF 607_000 , `read from the official page`)
            WHEN `the ceiling of section 49A(a1)` THEN NOTHING
            WHEN `the combined-value limit of section 49E(a)(3)` THEN NOTHING
            WHEN `the larger combined-value limit of section 49E(a1)` THEN NOTHING
        OTHERWISE NOTHING
